---
title: Autumn Chowder
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Soups
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@bacon{6%slices} (fried & crumbled)
@finely chopped onions{1%c}
@diced potatoes{2.5%c}
@milk{3%c}
@corn{2%16-oz cans} (drained)
@shredded cheddar cheese{3%c}
@water{1%c}
@sliced carrots{1%c}
@chicken bouillon{2%tsp}
@pepper{1/2%tsp}
@flour{3%tsp}

Fry bacon and onion until crisp. Drain. Add water, potatoes, bouillon and carrots. Cook until tender. Stir in milk, corn and pepper. Heat well. Mix cheese and flour. Add to soup mixture and stir until melted.
